WEBVTT

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:09.420
Whoa! The champion eats a full right!

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.780
Impossible! Why did he go for a full swing?

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.780
The champion goes backward in a daze!

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.780
C-Coach! Look at Ippo-kun!

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.500
He's...

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:26.000
not getting enough oxygen. It's cyanosis!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.010
<i>I can see very clearly that 
you are in way over your head.</i>

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:35.490
<i>Welcome to the briny deep.</i>

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.670
<i>The kid’s not used to that type of infighting.</i>

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:54.070
<i>Shimabukuro’s constant pressure 
quickly robbed him of his strength!</i>

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:57.190
<i>We’re now going to see what 
Shimabukuro is really made of.</i>

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:59.530
<i>He may not have Makunouchi's
 offensive capabilities,</i>

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>but he has a weapon that supersedes that!</i>

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.690
<i>He trades blows at the same pace and maintains constant airflow.</i>

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:09.870
<i>His strong legs allow him to bounce back immediately after taking a hit.</i>

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.680
<i>His stamina is peerless!</i>

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:14.840
<i>That stamina alone is one hell of a deadly weapon.</i>

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.550
Only fifteen seconds to go in the fifth round!

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:21.050
And here comes the challenger!

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:28.810
It’s one body blow after another!

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.400
That flurry of punches pushes
 him back into the ropes!

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:35.570
The champion’s face twists 
in agony! That’s gotta hurt!

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:39.400
The champion loses the ropes!

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.280
But he’s not getting away!

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:47.290
More body blows! He simply 
doesn’t let up with them!

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.040
Ugh, that looks painful.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.790
Even <i>I’m</i> beginning to choke.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.550
<i>C-Can’t breathe... I feel like I’m
 about to vomit up my insides!</i>

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:11.400
There’s the bell, folks!

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.460
That’s enough, Shimabukuro!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.690
Oh boy! The champion has most 
definitely seen better days!

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:23.910
He lies motionless on the ropes
 with a blank look on his face!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.080
No, perhaps he <i>can’t</i> move!

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:34.950
The stunned crowd looks on
 at the battered champion!

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.250
It’s as if a dark cloud is looming across the arena!

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:40.250
He came to the briny deep.

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.190
Yeah, you did great!

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:47.810
<i>I thought he would arrive sooner, but that guy is as stubborn as they come.</i>

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.200
<i>But he’s now in way too deep.</i>

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.220
<i>He will never be able to resurface.</i>

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:59.530
<i>That guy will keel over like a
 sunken ship in the next round.</i>

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.410
<i>Must replenish my strength.</i>

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:06.530
<i>My strength...</i>

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.780
<i>I didn’t use it because I was 
afraid it wouldn't work.</i>

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:12.540
<i>But he won’t go down unless I give all I got.</i>

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:16.140
<i>I must use it. I must gather up my strength.</i>

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:18.300
<i>The strength for my Dempsey Roll!</i>

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:22.080
<i>He’s gathering up his last remaining strength.</i>

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.090
<i>He's definitely betting the farm on something.</i>

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:27.310
<i>Is he going to go with the Dempsey Roll?</i>

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:32.720
<i>But that man practically guaranteed he'll beat it.</i>

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:36.310
<i>If the Dempsey Roll gets taken away from that kid...</i>

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:38.820
Seconds out!

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:42.320
This is yours to win! Now take the match to him!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.700
Time to sink him!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.350
I’m off.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:50.140
Round six!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:51.690
Box!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.920
The sixth round begins!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:57.980
The champion plods around heavily, indicative of the damage he took in the last round.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.000
But the challenger is not plunging ahead!

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.720
Instead he calmly and steadily closes in!

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:06.010
<i>There’s still a glint in your eyes.</i>

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:09.220
<i>You see a ray of light in the dark ocean bottom.</i>

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.510
<i>I know you do.</i>

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:14.480
<i>Then I’ll have to cut off that ray of hope,</i>

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:18.690
<i>and drag you down into the
 deepest, darkest depths!</i>

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.140
The challenger makes his move!

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.780
He lowers himself and submarines into the champion!

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:28.710
He deftly dodges a left and once again unleashes hell!

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:31.790
The champion looks to be in agony against that flurry of body blows!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.410
Get away, Makunouchi!

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.040
No, you better clinch him!

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:39.040
He pushes the challenger away! 
What a tortured look he's wearing!

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.050
Can he make his escape from hell?

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:42.800
<i>No you don’t!</i>

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:47.250
The champion lands a right 
from an awkward position!

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.930
<i>He still packs a heavy punch!</i>

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:52.490
He lands yet another blow!

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:56.060
He was so off-balance you had to see it to believe it.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:00.560
But the challenger’s still coming in swinging those heavy arms of his!

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:04.320
But he keeps whiffing! The champion’s weaving is that masterful!

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:20.790
Now the champion's making
 figure eights with his weaving!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.300
The challenger comes with his left!

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:25.590
But misses!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:31.050
The champion swings around like a pendulum, using that momentum to deliver...

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:34.510
The Dempsey Roll!

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:36.560
There it is, his ultimate weapon!

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:40.110
The challenger blocks with his life!

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.420
Finally!

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:42.690
Knock him down!

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.070
Give it all you got!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:52.070
He breaks through! The vitals are now exposed!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:58.450
<i>You saw your ray of light
 in the Dempsey Roll?</i>

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:01.270
<i>However, no light reaches the ocean bottom.</i>

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:04.670
<i>This is how I’ll beat your Dempsey Roll!</i>

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:09.070
Simultaneous blows!

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:14.140
The arena echoes with the sound of two 
Mack trucks colliding into each other!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.640
The challenger threw a heavy
 punch into the Dempsey Roll!

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:20.190
The champion recoils again!

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.040
Another thundering collision!

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.520
You can even see fresh blood 
coming out of both their faces!

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:29.530
But the champion keeps at it!

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:33.320
But they strike each other again! The challenger punches tit for tat!

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.850
<i>Unbelievable.</i>

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:38.330
<i>That’s his trick against the Dempsey? 
He’s not just hitting him at the same time.</i>

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.830
<i>He’s trading punches that would terrify anyone!</i>

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:44.290
The champion continues 
with his Dempsey Roll!

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:47.050
He’s betting all the chips 
that this will win it for him!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:53.550
<i>If you managed to throw a punch into the Dempsey Roll, it would make for a counter twice as powerful.</i>

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:59.560
<i>But doing that would be too risky. I thought it would be almost impossible to pull off!</i>

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:04.820
<i>But he has nerves of steel and the physique to withstand the Dempsey Roll.</i>

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:08.190
<i>Those two came together to
 produce those counterpunches.</i>

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:11.200
<i>And now the unthinkable has happened!</i>

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.530
Those punches are hard
 enough to put anyone out!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:17.200
Both their legs become shaky in the face of the mutual onslaught!

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.700
<i>No! My Dempsey Roll hasn't lost yet!</i>

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:21.990
I...

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:22.890
Ippo!

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:24.210
Senpai!

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:28.710
<i>Kid... he’s actually...</i>

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.390
<i>I-I’m not giving up!</i>

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:32.720
<i>Not without a fight!</i>

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:36.220
<i>There’s no recoil! That’s just a normal hook!</i>

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.250
That got him!

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.270
His head snaps toward the ceiling
 as he staggers backwards!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.270
<i>H-He’s finished!</i>

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.090
Only his arm and the ropes are keeping him up!

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:51.780
Is the champion just holding
 on to the last straw?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:55.550
But we’re now witnessing 
a shocker of a bombshell!

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:58.580
The Dempsey Roll has been beaten!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:02.490
The previously unbeatable Dempsey Roll has literally been smashed!

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:06.080
What a heroic gamble! He really
 is the Ryuukyuu Warrior!

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:08.060
<i>I tip my hat to you.</i>

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:09.590
<i>As your opponent, I’m impressed.</i>

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.350
<i>He is truly magnificent.</i>

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.590
<i>You are the pride of Okinawa!</i>

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:16.190
<i>I did it! I really did it!</i>

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.600
<i>I beat the Dempsey Roll!</i>

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.020
<i>But there’s one more thing I want besides the belt.</i>

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.950
<i>I want to be known as the most courageous man in Japan!</i>

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:29.690
<i>There is nothing that would make a fisherman prouder!</i>

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:34.820
<i>I cut off his last ray of light and won this battle between fellow seadogs!</i>

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:39.000
The challenger also appears to be battered and bruised after trading those blows!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.830
But will he now take this very rare
 opportunity to win the match?!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:58.170
Those blows took a toll on both his mind and body.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:08:59.840
He's really up the creek.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:03.850
The entire arena holds its breath as they wait for the crown to change hands!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.830
All you need to do is push him over!

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.140
Now take him out, Shimabukuro!

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:11.090
The belt is literally a low-hanging fruit!

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:13.680
He only has to stretch out his arm and pluck it!

00:09:20.010 --> 00:09:21.040
What is he...?

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:21.700
Why?

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:24.990
He’s not moving!

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:28.790
The champion’s on the verge of collapse, but the challenger just stands there!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:34.000
The belt’s all but his, but the challenger’s not moving an inch!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:37.840
<i>I've totally dominated this fishermen's battle.</i>

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.010
<i>But... I can’t move!</i>

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.140
Ah! It was those punches!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.760
Shimabukuro couldn’t have
 come out of that unscathed!

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:46.680
<i>Sh-Shimabukuro!</i>

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:49.770
<i>Did you sacrifice too much to beat the Dempsey Roll?</i>

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:53.520
H-He’s not moving... because he <i>can’t</i> move.

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:59.790
Look at Shimabukuro’s face.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:00.760
Is that...

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.030
...cyanosis?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.980
He’s running an oxygen debt.

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:06.790
They both went through the
 same infighting slugfest.

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:12.410
Now the oxygen debt is hitting him in the kneecaps like a mafia loan shark.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:14.760
Add to it the damage from the last go-round...

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:18.800
I can see the both of them
 stuck at the bottom of the sea.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.370
The clock winds down on this still life photo we’re seeing!

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.320
Only seven seconds left in the sixth round!

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:24.300
Five!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.280
Four!

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.310
Three!

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.310
Two!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.310
One!

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:30.550
There’s the bell!

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:32.700
The passing of the crown will have to wait!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:38.530
How are these Submarine Wars going to end?

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:49.240
Even if your Dempsey Roll got beat, your opponent had to sacrifice a lot to do it!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:52.290
Shimabukuro was barely able to stand up!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:52.750
Right.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.680
Control your breathing.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:58.280
Then drain each and every one of
 your blood cells for its oxygen!

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:01.010
If you can do that, you can
 stay under for three minutes!

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:03.050
Got it.

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:13.590
Hey, how’re you holding up?

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:16.060
His Dempsey Roll is to be feared.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:18.010
But...

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:23.570
I will spear my prey in the next round!

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:26.350
Yeah, that’s my fisherman!

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:27.370
Seconds out!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:33.000
With both boxers still licking their huge wounds, the bell for the seventh round...

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:34.460
has rung!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.210
Box!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.080
The challenger rushes in!

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:40.380
He makes a beeline toward the champion!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.990
He's recovered from his cyanosis!

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:45.090
Those underwater fishermen <i>do</i> have good lungs!

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:47.580
But he still got past the worst of it!

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:49.600
Senpai also had a minute to recover!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.890
He must've gotten his second wind!

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:59.550
What the hell’s with that love tap?!

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.140
He hasn’t recovered at all!

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:02.440
H-He’s in huge trouble!

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:08.050
The challenger lands blow after powerful blow!

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.240
He drives the champion back ever so furiously!

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:13.820
It’s like the last six rounds never happened to him!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.140
H-He’s going in for the kill.

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:18.710
He’s done. He’ll lose his belt.

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:21.870
The champion’s up against the ropes!

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:25.640
He’s not moving! He’s already at the end of the line!

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:29.900
The champion throws a left!

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.910
But it's shaken off!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:35.630
<i>I knew it! My prey has lost its steam!</i>

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:36.230
<i>He’s mine!</i>

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:39.520
Whoa! The challenger stoops down!

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:42.530
What punch is he going to land from down there?

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.630
A Gazelle Punch!

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.530
The champion’s knocked off his feet!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.530
All right!

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:51.340
But he's got his own glove under his chin!

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:54.040
He avoids a direct hit by a hair!

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:59.290
<i>I am </i>really <i>impressed! I’ve never
 had a prey as tenacious as you!</i>

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.010
But that still had to hurt!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.010
The champion’s trying to keep his balance!

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.730
He returns with a one-two punch!

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:09.570
Th-Those small punches won’t hurt him!

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.300
This is almost unbearable to watch.

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.970
The challenger comes back with a volley of blows!

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.810
The champion staggers with each strike!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.520
<i>Is his attachment to the belt the only thing keeping him up?</i>

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.810
<i>No.</i>

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:25.530
<i>Any half-hearted thoughts of 
defending would mean he's given up.</i>

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.530
<i>But the kid’s going entirely on the offensive.</i>

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.530
<i>Go for it! Go for it, kid!</i>

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:39.090
A massive left hook from the challenger!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.170
Whoa, that put him completely off balance!

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:49.930
<i>I will blast through that guard of yours!</i>

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:53.390
Another explosive Gazelle Punch!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:55.690
That lifted him clear off his feet!

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.100
Is he finished?

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.280
Nope, now he’s using both gloves!

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:02.860
He defended it using a double-arm block!

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:04.850
He escapes from the ropes!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.710
<i>Dammit, won’t you</i>  ever<i> go down?!</i>

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.860
<i>But as a seadog, I admire your guts!</i>

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:12.000
Go get him, Makunouchi!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.710
Don’t give up!

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:16.540
Makunouchi! Makunouchi!

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:22.540
Makunouchi! Makunouchi! Makunouchi! Makunouchi!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:28.070
The spectators call out Makunouchi's name urging him to fight on with his battered body!

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:30.180
<i>This doesn’t change anything.</i>

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.550
<i>It’s only a matter of time before he gives up his throne!</i>

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:36.560
<i>So, kid, can you still move? 
You got some steam left?</i>

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.600
<i>I’m still moving. I can still do this!</i>

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:44.480
<i>All I can do is believe in my coach to the very end!</i>

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:48.940
<i>He’s not exerting much strength.</i>

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:54.160
H... He’s not putting in much power,

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:58.200
and his punches are so basic, it’s like he’s just hitting some mitts.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:01.250
He’s totally lost in himself going after a pair of mitts!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.700
He cares not one whit about the belt!

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:06.330
He’s only focused on winning.

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.170
As if <i>he</i> was the challenger.

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:14.930
<i>Your punches are no good! 
Time to end this seadogs' fight!</i>

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:15.930
Kid!

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.680
You’re through, Makunouchi!

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:20.430
The challenger makes a headlong rush!

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:36.500
<i>His power, his speed, his timing...</i>

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:39.120
<i>they all meshed together to form the perfect hit!</i>

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.330
<i>The damage cut through Shimabukuro
 all the way to the bone!</i>

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.670
That got him, kid!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.590
Now hit him!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.820
I-It’s the Dempsey Roll!

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:55.510
He’s banking it all on his signature move!

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.180
<i>I rendered that move useless!</i>

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.140
It’s blow for blow!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:06.400
<i>This is a new game, and
 I’m not going to lose!</i>

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.650
<i>This is the last test of wills
 between two fellow fishermen!</i>

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:11.350
<i>I will </i> not<i> step back!</i>

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:15.750
They pound each other repeatedly
 with neither backing down!

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:17.910
Which titan will go down first?!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.920
Whoa! The champion staggers!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.150
H-He’s done for!

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.920
Is Shimabukuro the better deep sea fighter?

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.670
No, look!

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:39.180
Oh? Both boxers are struggling to stand up!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:42.180
<i>I can keep going! I can still punch!</i>

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.930
<i>I'm not losing this fishermen’s bou—</i>

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.690
Shimabukuro!

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:58.160
<i>My pride as a... seadog!</i>

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:11.680
<i>I feel for you.</i>

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:15.000
<i>You would have won at the bottom of the sea.</i>

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.920
<i>But this isn’t the ocean bottom.</i>

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.850
<i>It’s the inside of a ring.</i>

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:21.800
<i>I see.</i>

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.320
<i>He’s not a fisherman at all.</i>

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:28.790
<i>This wasn’t a battle between seadogs.</i>

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:34.430
<i>He’s a boxer through and... through.</i>

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.710
He’s down!

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:41.470
The Dempsey Roll made a crucial comeback!

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:45.530
The once unsinkable Ryuukyuu Warrior has now keeled over on the mat!

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:47.290
Get to a neutral corner!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.670
Uh oh! Just the mere touch from the referee nearly toppled him over!

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.790
The champion hangs onto the rope for dear life!

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.570
Get up, Shimabukuro!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:56.210
Makunouchi is completely out of gas!

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:57.590
If you get up, you win!

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:01.300
Weren’t you taking the belt back 
to Okinawa?! Don’t give up!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:04.810
Remember all your island buddies’ fishing flags!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.260
He couldn’t get up!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.390
The ten count is a cruel mistress!

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:46.220
At the end of this deathmatch, the champion remains the last man standing!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.240
Yeah!

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:51.230
With 2:15 left to go in the seventh round, 
Makunouchi successfully retains his belt!

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.430
Senpai!

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:50.000
You did it!

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:53.440
I did it...

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:55.980
I did it!

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:57.500
Kid!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.230
Coach!

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:01.210
I did it! This is great!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:04.020
I’m so happy about this win!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:05.740
Ippo-kun!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:12.080
You didn't look like any type of champion out there, but you toughed it out great, kid.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.250
Thank you very much!

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:16.310
You were still sloppy out there!

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:19.320
If you repeat what you did 
here, that’ll be the end of you!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:20.260
Right.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.760
You sure beat me.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:24.510
Shimabukuro-san.

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.820
The spectators shower the two giants with warm cheers and applause!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:36.560
Although he lost the match, the Ryuukyuu Warrior, Shimabukuro Iwao, fought a great fight!

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:40.280
I’m going to quit boxing.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:46.410
I got to fight a mountain of a man. That’s all I could ask for.

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:49.530
We fishermen live for the sea.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.040
You go...

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.410
live for the ring.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.290
You're strong, Makunouchi Ippo!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.300
Thank you very much!
